<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-22T22:38:33.798Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 22:38:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippines and France conducted a bilateral maritime exercise with the French Floréal class frigate FS Vendémiaire sailing alongside the Philippine guided-missile frigate BRP Diego Silang and the coast guard vessel BRP Sarangani. Finland and the Philippines discussed maritime security cooperation and signed a pact that includes Australian assistance for drones and cybersecurity. The Philippine Coast Guard increased its presence in Talisay and rescued 22 people from a distressed boat off Palawan. China and ASEAN countries continue to struggle over a South China Sea code of conduct, and 176 battle-related deaths were reported in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/china-asean-countries-struggle-over-south-china-sea-code-of-conduct/a-80009799?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPTVpNQ0wtMVAyamlvNmlHUGxuY29vTXlhX085QW5yOWY0WjU2dVM2cFYxdU9CcjVtTHVuVXRSSDlod2xPV2V3T2lESU90VDZ2eE9ldV9JblI3bHZHMVg5TXd6YjhOZC1iclZZU0RfQ2NYWUN2cWw1UlZfVXdyYVhDdU9WbGcyazFtN2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Manila Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philstar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQUjlEeUpRVUFJQTBaeWtxZkxXVU1UX3J4bFM4eTA4cmc1cFdaWS0wbWpycllxSk4wMnNJbzJPdDlzakU1OFdnblNfMkVkR05rWm83Z2JmRDV0aWh3V3E0dzJ4S09VODN2YmRZX1h2dllJcThsTm9zOW9rcld1Xy1haE9GSVZwbjFpX3hCLQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Scandasia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/ar